{"id":67600,"date":"2025-02-16T19:17:28","date_gmt":"2025-02-16T18:17:28","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=67600"},"modified":"2026-10-01T11:15:11","modified_gmt":"2026-10-01T10:15:11","slug":"ultra-madeira-banana-madeira","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/ultra-madeira-banana-madeira\/","title":{"rendered":"Ultra Madeira \u2013 Banana da Madeira 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Ultra Madeira \u2013 Banana da Madeira 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Ultra Madeira \u2013 Banana da Madeira 2026<\/strong> (10\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se nos dias <strong>3 e 4 de outubro de 2026<\/strong>, afirmando-se como a prova de abertura oficial do prestigiado <strong>Circuito Trail Madeira (\u00e9poca 2026-27)<\/strong>. Organizada pela <strong>AARAM \u2013 Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo da Regi\u00e3o Aut\u00f3noma da Madeira<\/strong>, a m\u00edtica travessia linear cruza a deslumbrante cordilheira da ilha da Madeira de oeste a leste, partindo do emblem\u00e1tico <strong>Farol da Ponta do Pargo<\/strong> at\u00e9 \u00e0 linha de meta consagrada no centro da vila do <strong>Cani\u00e7al<\/strong>, concelho de <strong>Machico<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O evento disponibiliza cinco desafios \u00e9picos adaptados a todos os patamares de resist\u00eancia: a prova rainha <strong>Ultra Madeira (92 km e 4570 m D+)<\/strong>, a exigente <strong>Ultra 55K (55 km e 3010 m D+)<\/strong> com partida na Encumeada, o <strong>Trail 30K (31,9 km e 1500 m D+)<\/strong> a arrancar de Porto da Cruz, o veloz <strong>Trail 17K (17,6 km e 411 m D+)<\/strong> da Portela e o acess\u00edvel <strong>Mini Trail (8 km e 290 m D+)<\/strong> no domingo. Os percursos combinam levadas hist\u00f3ricas, cumes vertiginosos, t\u00faneis vulc\u00e2nicos e fal\u00e9sias atl\u00e2nticas imponentes, oferecendo abastecimentos refor\u00e7ados, cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica e transporte oficial de atletas para todas as partidas a partir do Cani\u00e7al.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-s