ck;\">Trail Curto<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Trail 17K<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 3 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:00 \u2022 411m D+<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Geral (At\u00e9 6 de Setembro):<\/strong> 25.00 \u20ac (Filiados AARAM: 16.00 \u20ac)<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (06\/09\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Curto<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Mini Trail 8K<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 4 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:00 \u2022 290m D+<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Geral (At\u00e9 6 de Setembro):<\/strong> 15.00 \u20ac (Filiados AARAM: 13.50 \u20ac)<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (06\/09\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data e o local de realiza\u00e7\u00e3o da Ultra Madeira 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento decorre nos dias 3 e 4 de outubro de 2026, com todas as provas a culminarem na meta oficial situada no centro da vila do Cani\u00e7al, no concelho de Machico, Ilha da Madeira.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis e os respetivos desn\u00edveis acumulados?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A Ultra Madeira integra cinco dist\u00e2ncias: Ultra Madeira (92 km e +4570 m D+), Ultra 55K (55 km e +3010 m D+), Trail 30K (31,9 km e +1500 m D+), Trail 17K (17,6 km e +411 m D+) e Mini Trail (8 km e +290 m D+).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios e locais de partida de cada prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">No s\u00e1bado (03\/10), a Ultra Madeira (92K) parte \u00e0s 00:00 da Ponta do Pargo, a Ultra 55K \u00e0s 06:00 da Encumeada, o Trail 17K \u00e0s 09:00 da Portela e o Trail 30K \u00e0s 10:00 de Porto da Cruz. No domingo (04\/10), o Mini Trail (8K) parte \u00e0s 10:00 da Santa Casa da Miseric\u00f3rdia de Machico.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o disponibiliza transporte para os atletas at\u00e9 aos locais de partida?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim. A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o (AARAM) assegura o transporte de autocarro para os locais de partida de todas as provas, com concentra\u00e7\u00e3o obrigat\u00f3ria junto ao Museu da Baleia no Cani\u00e7al nas horas pr\u00e9vias a cada largada.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os prazos e valores de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o para a edi\u00e7\u00e3o de 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem at\u00e9 6 de setembro de 2026 na plataforma oficial. Os valores gerais s\u00e3o de 75,00 \u20ac (Ultra 92K), 55,00 \u20ac (Ultra 55K), 35,00 \u20ac (Trail 30K), 25,00 \u20ac (Trail 17K) e 15,00 \u20ac (Mini Trail), beneficiando os atletas filiados na AARAM de descontos exclusivos.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Ultra Madeira \u2013 Banana da Madeira 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-10-03\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Machico, Ilha da Madeira\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Machico, Ilha da Madeira\", \"addressRegion\": \"Machico, Ilha da Madeira\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data e o local de realiza\u00e7\u00e3o da Ultra Madeira 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento decorre nos dias 3 e 4 de outubro de 2026, com todas as provas a culminarem na meta oficial situada no centro da vila do Cani\u00e7al, no concelho de Machico, Ilha da Madeira.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis e os respetivos desn\u00edveis acumulados?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A Ultra Madeira integra cinco dist\u00e2ncias: Ultra Madeira (92 km e +4570 m D+), Ultra 55K (55 km e +3010 m D+), Trail 30K (31,9 km e +1500 m D+), Trail 17K (17,6 km e +411 m D+) e Mini Trail (8 km e +290 m D+).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios e locais de partida de cada prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"No s\u00e1bado (03\/10), a Ultra Madeira (92K) parte \u00e0s 00:00 da Ponta do Pargo, a Ultra 55K \u00e0s 06:00 da Encumeada, o Trail 17K \u00e0s 09:00 da Portela e o Trail 30K \u00e0s 10:00 de Porto da Cruz. No domingo (04\/10), o Mini Trail (8K) parte \u00e0s 10:00 da Santa Casa da Miseric\u00f3rdia de Machico.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o disponibiliza transporte para os atletas at\u00e9 aos locais de partida?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim. A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o (AARAM) assegura o transporte de autocarro para os locais de partida de todas as provas, com concentra\u00e7\u00e3o obrigat\u00f3ria junto ao Museu da Baleia no Cani\u00e7al nas horas pr\u00e9vias a cada largada.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os prazos e valores de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o para a edi\u00e7\u00e3o de 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem at\u00e9 6 de setembro de 2026 na plataforma oficial. Os valores gerais s\u00e3o de 75,00 \u20ac (Ultra 92K), 55,00 \u20ac (Ultra 55K), 35,00 \u20ac (Trail 30K), 25,00 \u20ac (Trail 17K) e 15,00 \u20ac (Mini Trail), beneficiando os atletas filiados na AARAM de descontos exclusivos.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":67601,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[22,497,498,499],"event_type_2":[36,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[868],"class_list":["post-67600","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-machico-ilha-da-madeira","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-trail-longo","event_type-trail-ultra","event_type_2-madeira","event_type_2-portugal","event_type_5-circuito-trail-madeira"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/cartaz-ultra-madeira.web